    <h3>4.1 SMS Program Description</h3>
    <p>Lead My Company supports automated transactional SMS communications for appointment confirmations, reminders, scheduling changes, rescheduling requests, and requested verification codes. Messages must identify the business responsible for sending them. Our transactional messaging service is not intended for unsolicited marketing or promotional communications.</p>
    <h3>4.2 SMS Consent</h3>
