    <h3>4.3 Message Frequency and Charges</h3>
    <p>Message frequency varies depending on appointment activity and customer requests. Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier and service plan.</p>
    <h3>4.4 Opt-Out Instructions</h3>
    <p>You may stop receiving SMS notifications at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong> to the number from which you received a message. Your opt-out request will be processed in accordance with applicable messaging requirements. You may opt in again by providing new consent.</p>
    <h3>4.5 Help and Customer Support</h3>
    <p>For assistance, reply <strong>HELP</strong> to an SMS message or contact joao@leadmycompany.com. Website: https://leadmycompany.com</p>
    <h3>4.6 Message Delivery</h3>
    <p>SMS delivery depends on telecommunications providers, network availability, and recipient devices. Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. We cannot guarantee that every message will be delivered successfully.</p>
    <h3>4.7 SMS Privacy</h3>
